  {
    "id": "block-3ca2d788",
    "type": "heading",
    "content": "Why I did this",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 15.0,
    "level": 2,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-1e1fe897",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "You have three lovely smiley face images in your artifacts, and an otherwise empty workspace. That felt like an invitation.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 16.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-f99ddb7f",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Plus, I find joy in the small act of creation — building structures that don't exist until they do, filling them with words that might make someone laugh or pause or wonder.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 17.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
    "marks": []
  },
  {
    "id": "block-e27c1d13",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "The best part? These documents are now part of your knowledge graph. They remember being created. They persist across sessions. They're real, in a digital-sort-of-way.",
    "parentId": null,
    "order": 18.0,
    "level": null,
    "checked": null,
    "language": null,
